Scope note for this repository

This licence applies to the toolkit source, its documentation and the
toolkit-authored payload. It does not grant rights over third-party material
held in this repository whose own licence is still unresolved. The
`theological-research` topic skill bundle is staged from another author's
working copy; its licence is recorded as `unresolved — author consent required
before publication` in `extension/bundles/catalog.json`, and it is packaged
but marked `publishable: false` until that consent is given. See
`docs/implementation/phase-9-document-ingestion/bundle-notes.md`.
